    "start": 2020,
    "end": 2035,
    "dt": 0.25
  },
  "source": "https://doi.org/10.1177/2332858417751803",
  "reference": "Carver-Thomas D, Darling-Hammond L (2017) Teacher Turnover: Why It Matters and What We Can Do About It. Learning Policy Institute.",
